      "title": "Hurricane Isaias forecast to bring dangerous storm surge, with millions under warnings in US",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/08/hurricane-isaias-gulf-coast",
      "description": "<p>Residents in areas from the mouth of the Mississippi River to Florida urged to ‘evacuate if told to do so’</p><p>Millions of people from Louisiana to Florida are under hurricane warnings on Thursday as <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/07/tropical-storm-isaias-mexico-hurricane\">Hurricane Isaias</a> heads toward the US Gulf coast with weather officials warning of dangerous storm surge, hurricane-force winds, heavy rainfall and flooding.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/07/tropical-storm-isaias-mexico-hurricane\">Isaias</a> intensified into a hurricane from a tropical storm on Wednesday night, <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/06/tropical-depression-gulf-hurricane\">becoming</a> the <a href=\"https://www.wbtv.com/2026/10/08/isaias-becomes-first-hurricane-atlantic-season/\">first hurricane</a> of the 2026 Atlantic hurricane season.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/08/hurricane-isaias-gulf-coast\">Continue reading...</a>",
